OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sex offences
OL,4,Aagainst child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has been jailed for
OL,7,Fchild sex offences after incriminating
OL,8,Fvideos were found on a youth's phone.
OL,10,FCleveland Police said they were alerted
OL,11,Fto the footage in June by what they
OL,12,Fdescribed as a concerned third-party,
OL,13,Fwith Alby Hunt arrested the following
OL,14,Fday.
OL,16,FHunt, from Stockton, later admitted
OL,17,Fcausing or inciting a child to engage
OL,18,Fin sexual activity, engaging in sexual
OL,19,Factivity with a child and attempting to
OL,20,Fengage in sexual activity in the
OL,21,Fpresence of a child.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
